{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"247970","name":"Korea. IL-2 Series","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/9e2e87b5be580e56a0d16e4245e3c501.avif?t=1787344656\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《IL2捍卫雄鹰：朝鲜战争》将带您回到人类航空史上的关键时刻——那个喷气式发动机彻底改变空中格局的时代。朝鲜战争期间，老式活塞飞机与最初的喷气式战斗机展开了激烈交锋。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/59c3d59cae557637b470533d37e6ff5f.poster.avif?t=1787344656\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/59c3d59cae557637b470533d37e6ff5f.webm?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/59c3d59cae557637b470533d37e6ff5f.mp4?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏包含幅员辽阔的战场、高度还原的战机，同时在沉浸感与操作便捷性之间进行了精妙的平衡调整，让每场空战都仿佛身临其境。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >您可以从王牌飞行员做起，驾驶传奇战机，或是一路晋升至团长，指挥整支空中中队。您可以规划航线、下达命令，亲手扭转历史走向。在朝鲜的天空中，您既可以是普通飞行员，也可以是左右战局的战略大师，选择权尽在您手中。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《IL2捍卫雄鹰：朝鲜战争》是该系列首部完全支持控制器操作的作品。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e54e9d90a06922bb4d3d9bfe51caf6b4.avif?t=1787344656\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏中的每架飞机都是根据朝鲜战争时期的真实蓝图、历史照片、飞行手册及相关资料精心复刻，共收录八种经典机型供您选择。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(*请注意，La‑11 和 F‑84E“雷电喷气”可在高级版和豪华版中获取，也可作为单独附加内容购买。)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/d0da77dd71852b853f00b7d97d519a50.avif?t=1787344656\" width=780 height=1388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >驾驶舱内所有仪表均可正常工作，实时反映飞机系统状态。您可以像75年前的飞行员一样，亲手瞄准、开火。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/121dc217f61ae85ab90697c44f0cb48b.avif?t=1787344656\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >本作战场是《IL2捍卫雄鹰》系列有史以来规模最为庞大的地图，总面积超过20万平方公里。整个朝鲜半岛基于20世纪50年代的历史地图与文献重建，所有重要的历史地貌变化，如填海造陆与海岸线变迁等，均在游戏中得到忠实还原。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >战场内包含数十座基于真实历史资料的空军基地、数百个居民点，以及众多港口、水坝、交通枢纽等战略目标。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/f2ca5a9b9c7a91897be594d89580eaef.poster.avif?t=1787344656\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/f2ca5a9b9c7a91897be594d89580eaef.webm?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/f2ca5a9b9c7a91897be594d89580eaef.mp4?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/720c87a69c221bf91afddae2bbc346f8.avif?t=1787344656\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“圣诞节之前就能回家”战役讲述了杰克·罗素上尉的故事：1950年，为了实现成为喷气式战斗机王牌飞行员的梦想，他设法获准调入一支参加朝鲜战争的作战部队。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家将驾驶战机执行15个符合史实的作战任务。这些任务均根据第8战斗轰炸联队的作战日志及其飞行员的回忆录还原。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >战役展现了战争初期数月所面临的特殊挑战：喷气式飞机无法在小型前沿机场起降和执行任务，因此部分飞行员不得不暂时改飞活塞式飞机。战役期间，玩家将驾驶F-51“野马”和F-80“流星”喷气式战机。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/9d2db750e53585dd7da91416b0d3d0f2.poster.avif?t=1787344656\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/9d2db750e53585dd7da91416b0d3d0f2.webm?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/9d2db750e53585dd7da91416b0d3d0f2.mp4?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/8afa860409f834ab6ea7c7448be04d63.avif?t=1787344656\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在生涯模式中，您将担任空中部队的指挥官，管理下属、统筹航空后勤。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >您既可以亲自驾机出击，也可专注于战略调度。身为指挥官，您需要维持部队战备，制定作战计划，不断强化您的空中力量。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/4aecf2908ec423c02dd408bec83d12ef.poster.avif?t=1787344656\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/4aecf2908ec423c02dd408bec83d12ef.webm?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/4aecf2908ec423c02dd408bec83d12ef.mp4?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/1540847d53d138a58573c7a69ac48229.avif?t=1787344656\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《IL2捍卫雄鹰：朝鲜战争》拥有高度精细的航空、地面单位的损伤模型。所有飞机（包括战略轰炸机）、地面车辆、火车、舰船，都会根据所受攻击的性质呈现相应的损伤状态。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每个物体都会对碰撞、坠毁与战斗损伤做出真实反应，质量、速度与撞击点等因素将直接影响载具行为及战斗结果。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e06e5d387bc7bd7e16de8d410c9ecd11.poster.avif?t=1787344656\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e06e5d387bc7bd7e16de8d410c9ecd11.webm?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e06e5d387bc7bd7e16de8d410c9ecd11.mp4?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/310ea453e4d1b564fe2fd6013df37461.avif?t=1787344656\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这个新模式中，您可以亲自查看每架飞机、每辆载具、每艘潜艇的详尽资料。您可以自由探索各式机型，了解其研发历程与作战历史，检查驾驶舱，比较技术规格，查看详细的性能图表。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这里是您专属的私人航空博物馆，随时静候您的光临。对于航空与军事历史爱好者而言，这无疑是一份真正的宝藏。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/d09c5c9f1d40902653201556a484e6dd.poster.avif?t=1787344656\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/d09c5c9f1d40902653201556a484e6dd.webm?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/d09c5c9f1d40902653201556a484e6dd.mp4?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/beaa5f18234f020b8fffea6b09fcacd9.avif?t=1787344656\" width=780 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在这款游戏中，您可以首次离开驾驶舱，在您所在部队的驻地机场内自由漫步。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏中所有角色（包括飞行员、士兵、平民）动画均采用动作捕捉技术制作，动作自然逼真。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e7bd9b7381e22e82785f30a1d148f480.poster.avif?t=1787344656\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e7bd9b7381e22e82785f30a1d148f480.webm?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/extras/e7bd9b7381e22e82785f30a1d148f480.mp4?t=1787344656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >专业沉浸体验设计：</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>通过 OpenXR 与 OpenVR 提供完整的 VR 支持。</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>便捷易用：</strong>游戏内含详尽的系统管理，不过您完全无需记忆引擎启动顺序——您可以即刻起飞，投入战斗。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>硬件支持：</strong>支持从游戏手柄、摇杆到专业 HOTAS 模拟套装在内的各类设备。</p></li></ul>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/c0d86dfb1e69d6165de8556949746d46e1d28f96/header.jpg?t=1787344656","website":"https://il2-korea.com/","developers":["FOR-GAMES CR LTD"],"publishers":["FOR-GAMES CR LTD"],"release_date":"2026 年 8 月 4 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"JPY","initial":"9850.00","final":"9850.00","discount":0},"supported_languages":"英语, 俄语, 简体中文, 法语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","多人","玩家对战","线上玩家对战","合作","在线合作","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","已支持 VR","Steam 集换式卡牌","视角舒适度","可调整难度","推荐使用手柄","无需应对快速反应事件","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","立体声","环绕声","包含关卡编辑器","可用 HDR","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","模拟"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> 4-Core CPU 3.6+ GHz<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 24 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> 8 Gb Graphics Card no more than 2 generations old (RTX 3060 or RX 7600 level)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 35 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>支持 VR:</strong> OpenXR or Steam VR supported headsets. VR Controllers are not supported.<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Gamepad or Joystick are recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> 8-Core CPU 4.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> 12+ Gb Graphics Card (RTX 4080 or 7900 XTX level)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 35 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>支持 VR:</strong> OpenXR or Steam VR headsets (16+ Gb Current Gen Graphics Card recommended). VR Controllers are not supported.<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Joystick or HOTAS system are recommended</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/8d6373c8d6d497dd52049721bd2ec8ea08f3100e/ss_8d6373c8d6d497dd52049721bd2ec8ea08f3100e.600x338.jpg?t=1787344656","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/8d6373c8d6d497dd52049721bd2ec8ea08f3100e/ss_8d6373c8d6d497dd52049721bd2ec8ea08f3100e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787344656"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/a3fe9b380c762b69418b82493fed850a20605182/ss_a3fe9b380c762b69418b82493fed850a20605182.600x338.jpg?t=1787344656","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/a3fe9b380c762b69418b82493fed850a20605182/ss_a3fe9b380c762b69418b82493fed850a20605182.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787344656"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/744348b45f04284c6b682a344ad6788dd77cbd96/ss_744348b45f04284c6b682a344ad6788dd77cbd96.600x338.jpg?t=1787344656","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/247970/744348b45f04284c6b682a344ad6788dd77cbd96/ss_744348b45f04284c6b682a344ad6788dd77cbd96.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787344656"}]}